# Python conventions

- Python 3.11+; package lives under `src/tensemem/`.
- Prefer clear names and small modules; match existing layout (`core`, `pipeline`, `storage`, `providers`, …).
- Type-annotate public APIs; project uses pyright strict.
- Tests in `tests/`; no live network in default pytest (use fakes/cassettes).
- Do not add dependencies unless needed for the change; optional extras stay optional.
- Resolver and apply logic must stay deterministic and unit-testable without an LLM.
